    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sammy-supervised PSP classic &quot;Phantom Thief Twin Angel - Labyrinth of Time and World&quot; gets HD remaster! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaster features full HD visuals, remastered sound effects, multilingual support, and other optimizations for a modern visual novel experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiichi Kanoh, the director and writer of the original PSP game, returns as executive producer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haruka Minazuki and Aoi Kannazuki are ordinary schoolgirls at St. Cherine School.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by night, they transform into the righteous heroines, <strong>'Phantom Thief Angels TwinAngel'</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing school life with their nighttime battles against a massive conspiracy, they work alongside Kurumi Hazuki, Tesla, and Nine to thwart the evil organization The Black Fund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though they successfully reclaim the stolen artifact 'Tears of an Angel,' their victory is short-lived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artifact is stolen again, leading them on a new adventure where they encounter two unfamiliar Phantom Thief Angels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets behind the birth of 'TwinAngel' and witness the power of their unwavering bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game that progresses through scenario text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will change depending on which route you take with the main characters Haruka and Aoi, and after you've cleared the game, you'll be able to choose the Tesla route, where all the mysteries are revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the PC port, we have made improvements to the original software, such as upgrading the screen to full HD, remaking the sound effects, and optimizing the novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to production specifications, the game does not currently feature character voices, but by purchasing additional DLC, it can be enhanced to 'Re:light+' and feature full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u24b8Sammy \u24b8Bit groove promotion Inc. \u24b8ALTERCIWS LLC/Lobstudio Inc.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sammy-supervised PSP classic &quot;Phantom Thief Twin Angel - Labyrinth of Time and World&quot; gets HD remaster! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The remaster features full HD visuals, remastered sound effects, multilingual support, and other optimizations for a modern visual novel experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiichi Kanoh, the director and writer of the original PSP game, returns as executive producer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haruka Minazuki and Aoi Kannazuki are ordinary schoolgirls at St. Cherine School.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by night, they transform into the righteous heroines, <strong>'Phantom Thief Angels TwinAngel'</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balancing school life with their nighttime battles against a massive conspiracy, they work alongside Kurumi Hazuki, Tesla, and Nine to thwart the evil organization The Black Fund.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though they successfully reclaim the stolen artifact 'Tears of an Angel,' their victory is short-lived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artifact is stolen again, leading them on a new adventure where they encounter two unfamiliar Phantom Thief Angels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secrets behind the birth of 'TwinAngel' and witness the power of their unwavering bonds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game that progresses through scenario text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story will change depending on which route you take with the main characters Haruka and Aoi, and after you've cleared the game, you'll be able to choose the Tesla route, where all the mysteries are revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the PC port, we have made improvements to the original software, such as upgrading the screen to full HD, remaking the sound effects, and optimizing the novel game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to production specifications, the game does not currently feature character voices, but by purchasing additional DLC, it can be enhanced to 'Re:light+' and feature full voice acting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u24b8Sammy \u24b8Bit groove promotion Inc. \u24b8ALTERCIWS LLC/Lobstudio Inc.</p>",
    "short_description": "Let's Go Fever Time! Lovely Angel! By day, ordinary girls. By night, the 'Phantom Thief Angels TwinAngel' - on a mission to reclaim stolen treasures. Winter 2024: The Angels descend on Steam.",
